{"title": "My Thanks, Cora", "pageid": 30840, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/My_Thanks,_Cora", "categories": ["Notes", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Note_W_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Book_Note_W_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_W_Image.png.webp, /w/images/9/9a/Book_Note_W_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"My Thanks, Cora image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Book_Note_W_Image.png/300px-Book_Note_W_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Book_Note_W_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>My Thanks, Cora</b> is a letter from <a href=\"/wiki/Jacek\" title=\"Jacek\">Jacek</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cora_Highberry\" title=\"Cora Highberry\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Portrait_Cora_Highberry.png/25px-Portrait_Cora_Highberry.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Portrait_Cora_Highberry.png/38px-Portrait_Cora_Highberry.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Portrait_Cora_Highberry.png/50px-Portrait_Cora_Highberry.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cora Highberry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Portrait_Cora_Highberry.png/25px-Portrait_Cora_Highberry.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Portrait_Cora_Highberry.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cora_Highberry\" title=\"Cora Highberry\">Cora Highberry</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This book is redolent with the enticing smell of paper and ink.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/38px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/50px-Notes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Notes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png/25px-Notes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Notes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Notes\" title=\"Notes\">Notes</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Jacek\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jacek\" title=\"Jacek\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Jacek.png/25px-Portrait_Jacek.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Jacek.png/38px-Portrait_Jacek.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Jacek.png/50px-Portrait_Jacek.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jacek\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Portrait_Jacek.png/25px-Portrait_Jacek.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Portrait_Jacek.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jacek\" title=\"Jacek\">Jacek</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: .05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the first floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Highberry%27s_Home\" title=\"Highberry's Home\">Highberrys' Home</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-4&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-32</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A letter penned on official Flaming Fist parchment.]\n</p><p><br>\nThank you, Cora, for taking <a href=\"/wiki/Molly\" title=\"Molly\">Molly</a> under your wring. I wish there was another way - that I could stay and look after her myself, but when the Fist calls, I have to answer. I'll be back before you know it, I'm sure - I've got <a href=\"/wiki/Ephren\" title=\"Ephren\">Ephren</a> looking out for me, after all!\n</p><p>Yours vigilantly,\n</p><p>Jacek\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202856\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1584/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18120/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5858/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 881438/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.016      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.016      1 -total\n 53.74%   20.968      7 Template:Icon_text\n 50.56%   19.726      1 Template:PageSeo\n 50.40%   19.664      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 45.67%   17.817     15 Template:Trim\n 37.42%   14.599      2 Template:CharLink\n 37.08%   14.466      3 Template:Icon_link\n 28.71%   11.201      7 Template:Ifempty\n  9.74%    3.799      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30840-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202856 and revision id 394191. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}